#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 7 15) (`the fee prescribed for` `receipt or renewal of a licence`)               EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 7 15) (`the total to be tendered for` `appeal against a practical examination score`) EQUALS NOTHING
