#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 7 16) (`the total to be tendered for` `appeal against a theoretical examination score`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 5 4)  (`the total to be tendered for` `appeal against a theoretical examination score`) EQUALS JUST 198
